### API Usage Examples
<details>
<summary><b>Creating a New Flow (GraphQL)</b></summary>

```graphql
mutation CreateFlow {
  createFlow(
    modelProvider: "openai"
    input: "Test the security of https://example.com"
  ) {
    id
    title
    status
    createdAt
  }
}
```

</details>

